Islam.
Situs kudus Islam meliputi
<ul>
<li>Shrine of al-Sheikh Amer</li>
<li>Shrine of "to the Prophet we go" ()</li>
<li>Shrine of Shihab ad-Din.</li>
</ul>
Tempat ibadah umat Islam termasuk
